pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
elements:
  - elementId: kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 40, 400, 18]
    content: {style: "$small", color: "$accent", letterSpacing: 3, wrap: false, text: "11 · 失败实验披露"}
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 62, 820, 38]
    content: {style: "$h1", wrap: false, text: "我们也失败 —— 并且全部留档"}
  - elementId: intro
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 106, 800, 26]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      color: "$muted"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>诚实披露失败是研究平台成熟度的标志。以下实验均未达标，记录完整保留：</p>
  - elementId: fail-table
    elementType: table
    bounds: [80, 146, 800, 190]
    columnWidths: [0.34, 0.42, 0.24]
    rowHeights: [0.16, 0.21, 0.21, 0.21, 0.21]
    style: "$dark"
    rows:
      - - text: "实验"
        - text: "结果"
        - text: "证据"
      - - {text: "ML stacking（GBM/Ridge/XGBoost）", align: [left, middle]}
        - {text: "OOS 夏普 -0.78 / -0.24 / -0.80，全部不如单因子 1.78 —— 无可交易边", align: [left, middle], color: "$warn", fontSize: 10}
        - {text: "ml_stack_snapshot_crypto.json", fontSize: 9}
      - - {text: "A 股微盘 v2_u249", align: [left, middle]}
        - {text: "净成本后 -14.6%，夏普 -0.24，被证伪", align: [left, middle], color: "$warn", fontSize: 10}
        - {text: "dry_run.db（保留）", fontSize: 9}
      - - {text: "统一执行 book 组合", align: [left, middle]}
        - {text: "净成本后分散不兑现：1.14–1.21 < 单条 1.38", align: [left, middle], color: "$warn", fontSize: 10}
        - {text: "dry_run.db 第 4/5 条", fontSize: 9}
      - - {text: "17 变体中的 9 个", align: [left, middle]}
        - {text: "REJECTED；3d 变体 DSR≈0.001，统计上不显著", align: [left, middle], color: "$warn", fontSize: 10}
        - {text: "crowd_contra_variants.json", fontSize: 9}
  - elementId: claim
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 370, 800, 90]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 15
      lineHeight: 1.8
      text: |
        <p><span style="color:$accent">■</span> ML 层的结论：瓶颈在数据/信号类，不在建模 —— 这指明了下一步投入方向</p>
        <p><span style="color:$accent">■</span> 失败记录与成功记录<strong>并列存证于同一数据库</strong>，投资人技术顾问可逐条复核</p>
  - elementId: src
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 478, 800, 30]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      text: |
        <p>我们承诺：本材料不含任何无法出示证据的绩效声明</p>
